      "act": "OUTPUT",
      "role_note": "wrapping the same, already-verified logic",
      "narration_text": "The API doesn't reimplement anything. One route, one publication number in, the same ClaimsAgent and LineageAgent that were already tested through the CLI, called the same way. A real classify flag, same purpose as the CLI's no-classify option — skip the one part that always costs something real.",
